  "id": "projective-technique",
  "term": "projective technique",
  "definition": "A projective technique is a psychological assessment approach exemplified here by the Sentence Completion Test, used in screening to gather responses in a less direct way than self-report questionnaires. In this source, it is presented as having potential when response deception or social desirability may affect self-reports, although it has traditionally been limited by manual scoring and cost.",
